Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Test Plugins|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|test-jsr-286-plt-26-6-portlet|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG
Scenario: View JSR
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Test JSR 286 PLT.26.6 Page|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Test JSR 286 PLT.26.6|
	And Click at locator 'TestJSR#TEST_ACTION_URL'
	And AssertElementNotPresent the value 'FAILED' at locator 'TestJSR#TEST_PORTLET_BODY_FAILED'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test JSR 286 PLT.26.6 Page|
	And Click at locator 'TestJSR#TEST_RENDER_URL'
	And AssertElementNotPresent the value 'FAILED' at locator 'TestJSR#TEST_PORTLET_BODY_FAILED'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test JSR 286 PLT.26.6 Page|
	And Click at locator 'TestJSR#TEST_RESOURCE_URL'
	Then AssertElementNotPresent the value 'FAILED' at locator 'TestJSR#TEST_PORTLET_BODY_FAILED'